OL,3,GNEWSAFestive art project brings
OL,4,Agenerations together
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren and care home residents in
OL,7,FKent have shared festive memories as
OL,8,Fpart of an art project designed to
OL,9,Fbring different generations together.
OL,11,FResidents at Woodstock Care Home in
OL,12,FSittingbourne and children from Years 5
OL,13,Fand 6 at Tunstall School met on Tuesday
OL,14,Fto share memories of Christmas in the
OL,15,Fpast.
OL,17,FThe pupils listened to their stories
OL,18,Fabout festive traditions and
OL,19,Fcelebrations from previous decades
OL,20,Fbefore creating artwork inspired by
OL,21,Ftheir recollections.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
