OL,3,GNEWSAFestive art project brings
OL,4,Agenerations together
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo students, Tilly and Holly, told the
OL,7,FBBC they "enjoyed spreading the
OL,8,FChristmas joy to both residents and
OL,9,Ftheir own families".
